pWM text window manager

Layout: automatic tiled terminals, up to 4 windows.

Controls:
  Ctrl+Q       Open a new terminal
  Ctrl+C       Close the active terminal
  Ctrl+Left    Focus the previous terminal
  Ctrl+Right   Focus the next terminal
  Mouse wheel  Scroll the active terminal

Commands:
  pwm --help   Show command usage
  pwm --info   Show this information
  pwm --reload Reset the active terminal view
  pwm --start  Start pWM from the minimal shell
  pwm --stop   Stop pWM and return to the minimal shell

